line	<col=000080>Bank all items EXCEPT Glarial's pebble, some food and a transport method (Runes won't be allowed since you won't be able to enter the tomb if you have anything deemed "not peaceful" in your possession; Jewellery is allowed including any jewellery that has any combat bonuses. You must have at least 2 open inventory spaces).</col>
